WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.202
Instead of a menu, a call entry point can hand its calls to

00:00:07.202 --> 00:00:08.680
an AI voice agent:

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:12.990
an AI profile that greets the caller and holds the conversation.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:18.086
When the Telnyx AI Voice Agent feature is on, Route to on the

00:00:18.086 --> 00:00:23.017
Routing card offers AI voice agent, with the AI agent profile to pick.

00:00:23.017 --> 00:00:26.390
The welcome message and the menu are not used.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:30.940
The AI can pass a caller to a person with the hand-off set

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.483
on the subject flow.

00:00:32.483 --> 00:00:37.114
While the entry point is closed, callers go to voicemail, or are refused

00:00:37.114 --> 00:00:39.430
when the closed action is Reject.

